		{
			"date": "2014-08-17T21:05:33Z",
			"message": "sprites: Fix flipped monster sprite.\nThe CYBRA7 sprite is supposed to be a flipped version of the CYBRA3\nsprite, but was actually just a clone of it. This meant that the\nmonster did not animate properly when viewed at a particular angle.\nFlip the sprite so that it animates correctly.\nThis fixes #83.",
			"source": "freedoom",
			"url": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/9522dd9ed45e0cefafc1d8420aab3c7a37c6e6af",
