			"date": "2023-07-17T02:14:24-04:00",
			"message": "png: Map color 255 to color 133 (#1003)\nSince color index 255 is a special transparent color in some game\r\nengines color 255 has been mapped to similar color 133 using make\r\ntarget 'fix-legacy-transparency-pngs'. The images have also been\r\nnormalized with make target 'fix-deutex-pngs'.",
			"source": "freedoom",
			"url": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/57246cae8f7901d4bc63072f9632685d1e3b507d",
