		{
			"date": "2023-10-30T09:28:37-07:00",
			"message": "sprites: make worm and tripod flippable. (#1138)\nThere is no reason whatsoever for the worm to have 8 rotations separately defined on any of its animations.\r\nThe tripod unlike the cyberdemon (or large technospider) is fully symmetrical as well.\r\nI'd suggest doing this for the zombieman since no one's going to notice anyway, but I'm not the one who had put the work into those additional rotations.",
			"source": "freedoom",
			"url": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/86482d5a10f7a6dcb0a913d01b839cf54c240dce",
